    "body": "Those both worked. I am seeing this error elsewhere in PHP so you are right that there is something odd afoot. I'm new to dev in a Windows environment so I'm sure I didn't do something right.\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ php -nr \"echo PHP_MAJOR_VERSION.'.'.PHP_MINOR_VERSION.'.'.PHP_RELEASE_VERSION;\"\r\n7.4.1\r\n\r\n❯ php -d \"error_reporting=0\" -r \"echo PHP_MAJOR_VERSION.'.'.PHP_MINOR_VERSION.'.'.PHP_RELEASE_VERSION;\"\r\n7.4.1\r\n```",
